<title>LITHUANIA: ROKISHKIS SEES 17 MLN LITAS 1997 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>ROKISHKIS SEES 17 MLN LITAS 1997 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian dairy company Rokishkis Cheese (RC) said on Thursday it expected a 17 million litas profit in 1997.  </p>
<p>&quot;We are optimistic about our future in 1997 and expect around 17 million litas profit this year,&quot; Valerija Siminiene, an economist at RC, told Reuters by telephone.</p>
<p>The company said its internationally audited net profit in 1996 was 10.5 million litas versus 12.9 million litas reported in an unaudited balance sheet.</p>
<p>The company said its 1995 net profit was 9.3 million litas.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
